    <innerclass refid="classhorus__control_1_1GravityModel" prot="public">horus_control::GravityModel</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacehorus__control">horus_control</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Gravity torques of a kinematic chain from its URDF (KDL), the math behind the GravityCompensation controller, kept separate so it is unit-testable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The chain runs from <computeroutput>root</computeroutput> to <computeroutput>tip</computeroutput> in the URDF; its movable joints must be exactly the joints the controller commands (any order). compute() returns, for a joint configuration q, the torque that holds every link of the chain still against gravity, G(q). Links need &lt;inertial&gt; data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
